---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navigation from "../components/navigation.jsx";
import Footer from "../components/footer.jsx";
import Button from "../components/button.jsx";
import {
  SparklesIcon,
  TagIcon,
  RocketLaunchIcon,
  FlagIcon,
} from "@heroicons/react/24/outline";
import { registerUrl } from "../config";

const title = "About Us - Opspot Security Guard Management Software";
const description =
  "Opspot was built from inside the industry after seeing how enterprise security software leaves small teams with too much complexity and cost. Bootstrapped and focused on making security companies safer and more efficient.";
const keywords =
  "about opspot, security guard software for small teams, tracktik alternative, simple security operations software";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <Navigation client:load pathname="/about" />

  {/* Header */}
  <header class="bg-white pt-48 pb-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      {/* Left: intro copy */}
      <div class="text-left">
        <p class="text-brand-primary text-xxs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          About us
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-gray-900 text-xl leading-tight font-bold mb-6">
          Security software small teams will actually use
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-md leading-relaxed">
          Our premise is simple: most guard software is built for the big
          players. This leaves smaller teams with tools that are too complex,
          hard to learn, and unnecessarily expensive. We built Opspot to change
          that.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Right: decorative tile cluster. Placeholders for imagery, hidden on
          small screens where a staggered grid under the copy reads awkwardly. */}
      <div
        class="hidden lg:grid grid-cols-3 grid-rows-3 gap-4 w-4/5 ml-auto"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <div class="col-start-2 row-start-1 aspect-square rounded-lg bg-gray-300"></div>
        <div class="col-start-2 row-start-2 aspect-square rounded-lg bg-gray-200"></div>
        <div class="col-start-3 row-start-2 aspect-square rounded-lg bg-gray-100"></div>
        <div class="col-start-1 row-start-3 aspect-square rounded-lg bg-brand-primary bg-opacity-10"></div>
        <div class="col-start-3 row-start-3 aspect-square rounded-lg bg-brand-primary bg-opacity-10"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  {/* Narrative */}
  <div class="bg-white pb-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-lg leading-tight font-bold mb-6">Built from the inside</h2>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          Opspot began with something our founder saw firsthand. After seeing how the sausage was made with
          one of the big players in the industry, one thing stood out: the systems has been rigged for large, enterprise teams. That
          scale brought complexity, and a long list of features most teams don't want.
        </p>
        <p>
          The products were bloated, and the price tags matched. Smaller
          companies were paying enterprise rates for tools their guards found
          frustrating to use, so most of it just sat there unused.
        </p>
        <p>
          We were sure there was a better way. So we set out to build the
          essentials, and to build them really well. Software your team will
          actually reach for every shift, without the weight of features meant
          for operations ten times your size.
        </p>
        <p>
          That is the whole idea behind Opspot: a genuinely good product with
          fair pricing baked in. Something that feels good to use whether you are
          out in the field or running the operation from the office.
        </p>
        <p>
          One last thing worth saying. Most companies in this space are backed by
          private equity or venture capital, which brings constant pressure to
          chase returns. We are bootstrapped, and we plan to stay that way. It
          keeps us focused on one thing: helping security companies work more
          safely and efficiently. We answer to the teams who use Opspot, not to
          investors.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* What we believe */}
  <div class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-lg leading-tight font-bold mb-12 text-center">
        What we believe
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-14">
        <div>
          <SparklesIcon className="h-7 w-7 text-brand-primary mb-4" />
          <h3 class="text-md font-bold mb-3">Simple beats complex</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
            A tool your guards actually use beats a tool with every feature and
            no adoption. We keep Opspot focused on what teams do every shift.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <TagIcon className="h-7 w-7 text-brand-primary mb-4" />
          <h3 class="text-md font-bold mb-3">Quality shouldn't be expensive</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
            Small teams should not have to pay enterprise prices to run a
            professional operation. Good software should be within reach.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <RocketLaunchIcon className="h-7 w-7 text-brand-primary mb-4" />
          <h3 class="text-md font-bold mb-3">Hassle free startup</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
            No service agreement, no training required. We set up your account
            and migrate your data for you, so getting started feels easy and you
            are live inside of a week.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <FlagIcon className="h-7 w-7 text-brand-primary mb-4" />
          <h3 class="text-md font-bold mb-3">Independent and bootstrapped</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
            No private equity or venture backers to answer to. That keeps our
            focus on one thing, making security companies safer and more
            efficient.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* CTA */}
  <div class="bg-black py-24 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-white text-lg leading-tight font-bold mb-6">
        See if Opspot fits your team
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Try Opspot free, or talk to us about moving your team over. No credit
        card required.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
        <Button
          text="Get started for free"
          icon={true}
          iconPosition="right"
          density="tight"
          location="about_cta"
          link={registerUrl()}
        />
        <Button
          text="Talk to us"
          density="tight"
          type="ghost"
          location="about_cta"
          link="/contact"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
